# Python / SQLModel

Full reference: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) and [`.agents/rules/python-sqlmodel.md`](../../.agents/rules/python-sqlmodel.md).

## Layout

- `src/models/` — tables + Create/Update/Delete schemas
- `src/models/__init__.py` — **only** `table=True` classes
- `src/enums/` — `StrEnum` only
- `src/constants/model.py` — `ORM_METADATA`
- `src/lib/` — auth, db, exceptions (not table models)
- `src/services/api/routes/` — thin handlers

## `__init__.py`

Only `src/models/__init__.py` is allowed. Ask before adding any other.

## Model example

```python
class User(UserBase, TimestampMixin, VerificationMixin, Base, table=True):
    __tablename__ = "users"
    id: str = Field(primary_key=True, max_length=255)  # Clerk sub
    onboarding_done: bool = Field(default=False)
```

Mixins in `models/common.py`. Base in `models/base.py`.

## Typing

- `from __future__ import annotations`
- `X | None`; `Annotated[T, Depends(...)]`
- Migrations: autogenerate only (`pnpm run db:make`)
